      {
        "clause": "28.1.1",
        "feature": "Reflect.apply",
        "status": "Supported with Limitations",
        "specUrl": "https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-reflect.apply",
        "testScripts": [
          "tests/Jroc.Test262.Tests/built-ins/Reflect/apply/ExecutionTests.cs"
        ],
        "test262Paths": [
          "test/built-ins/Reflect/apply/call-target.js"
        ],
        "notes": "Calls the target with the supplied this value and an argument list built with CreateListFromArrayLike, so array-like sources and holes are read by index and surface as undefined. Non-callable targets throw a TypeError. Argument-list coercion edge cases and abrupt completions from exotic array-likes are not yet covered."
      },
      {
        "clause": "28.1.2",
        "feature": "Reflect.construct",
        "status": "Supported with Limitations",
        "specUrl": "https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-reflect.construct",
        "notes": "The runtime exposes Reflect.construct and validates constructor targets/newTarget values, but this surface is documented as limited until broader Reflect and constructor-edge test262 coverage is imported."
      },
      {
        "clause": "28.1.3",
        "feature": "Reflect.defineProperty",
        "status": "Supported with Limitations",
        "specUrl": "https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-reflect.defineproperty",
        "testScripts": [
          "tests/Jroc.Test262.Tests/built-ins/Reflect/defineProperty/ExecutionTests.cs"
        ],
        "notes": "Reflect.defineProperty delegates to Object.defineProperty and returns true for successful descriptor definition. Current test262 coverage includes descriptor definition, symbol-keyed properties, length, and name."
      },
      {
        "clause": "28.1.4",
        "feature": "Reflect.deleteProperty",
        "status": "Supported with Limitations",
        "specUrl": "https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-reflect.deleteproperty",
        "testScripts": [
          "tests/Jroc.Test262.Tests/built-ins/Reflect/deleteProperty/ExecutionTests.cs"
        ],
        "test262Paths": [
          "test/built-ins/Reflect/deleteProperty/delete-properties.js"
        ],
        "notes": "Performs the target [[Delete]] and reports the Boolean result rather than throwing for non-configurable properties, which is the observable difference from a strict-mode delete. Proxy deleteProperty traps are honored. Abrupt completions from property-key coercion are not yet covered."
      },
      {
        "clause": "28.1.5",
        "feature": "Reflect.get",
        "status": "Supported with Limitations",
        "specUrl": "https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-reflect.get",
        "testScripts": [
          "tests/Jroc.Test262.Tests/built-ins/Reflect/get/ExecutionTests.cs"
        ],
        "test262Paths": [
          "test/built-ins/Reflect/get/return-value.js",
          "test/built-ins/Reflect/get/return-value-from-receiver.js"
        ],
        "notes": "Implements OrdinaryGet including prototype-chain lookup and the optional receiver argument, so accessor getters are invoked with the receiver as their this value. Getters that are undefined return undefined. Abrupt completions from property-key coercion are not yet covered."
      },
      {
        "clause": "28.1.6",
        "feature": "Reflect.getOwnPropertyDescriptor",
        "status": "Supported with Limitations",
        "specUrl": "https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-reflect.getownpropertydescriptor",
        "testScripts": [
          "tests/Jroc.Test262.Tests/built-ins/Reflect/getOwnPropertyDescriptor/ExecutionTests.cs"
        ],
        "test262Paths": [
          "test/built-ins/Reflect/getOwnPropertyDescriptor/return-from-data-descriptor.js"
        ],
        "notes": "Returns a FromPropertyDescriptor result for own properties with the spec property order (value, writable, enumerable, configurable) and undefined for missing own properties. Accessor-descriptor and symbol-key shapes are not yet covered by checked-in tests."
      },
      {
        "clause": "28.1.7",
        "feature": "Reflect.getPrototypeOf",
        "status": "Supported with Limitations",
        "specUrl": "https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-reflect.getprototypeof",
        "testScripts": [
