        ],
        "notes": "Marks the target non-extensible and returns a Boolean. Subsequent property definition and prototype mutation on the target throw a TypeError through Object.defineProperty and Object.setPrototypeOf. Proxy preventExtensions trap results are not yet covered by checked-in tests."
      },
      {
        "clause": "28.1.12",
        "feature": "Reflect.set",
        "status": "Supported with Limitations",
