        ],
        "notes": "Implements OrdinarySetPrototypeOf and reports failure with a Boolean instead of throwing, which is the observable difference from Object.setPrototypeOf. Returns true when the prototype is unchanged, and false for a non-extensible target or a cyclic prototype chain. Non-object, non-null proto values throw a TypeError."
